    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't. \"Trash all of the digivolution cards of those Digimon\" is an explanation of what happens to the digivolution cards of the Digimon when it returns to their hand. It doesn't count as trashing digivolution for the purposes of this card's effect.",
